pple智能","url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzYzNDE5MDEwMQ%3D%3D&mid=2247489416&idx=1&sn=9525f61df8086fcd6fe4d4183da068de"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/upl3hjjdokqe13w3ieo9opr0v","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"tip","id":"upl3hjjdokqe13w3ieo9opr0v","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/upl3hjjdokqe13w3ieo9opr0v","published_at":"2026-10-31T00:00:00Z","ref":"A4","score":70,"selected":true,"source":"OpenRouter：Announcements（RSS）","summary":"OpenRouter 发布教程，演示用 @openrouter/agent 0.11.0 在 TypeScript 中搭建定时运行的常驻 AI Agent，监控 Hacker News 并生成摘要。","title":"OpenRouter 教程：用 Agent SDK 搭建常驻 AI Agent 监控 Hacker News","title_en":"How to Build Your Own Always-On AI Agent","url":"https://openrouter.ai/blog/tutorials/build-always-on-ai-agent/"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/la0qb77ds4znf2r7ub14a3bqz","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"paper","id":"la0qb77ds4znf2r7ub14a3bqz","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/la0qb77ds4znf2r7ub14a3bqz","published_at":"2026-10-30T22:51:44Z","ref":"A5","score":83,"selected":true,"source":"Wiz：Research（安全研究）","summary":"Wiz 研究团队梳理 10 月内至少九个 AI 开发者平台披露的安全事件，包括 Fireworks AI、Lightning AI、Railway、Warp、OpenCode 等，多起报告指向凭据窃取、agent swarm 攻击和以“蒸馏”为目的的窃取。","title":"Wiz 报告“黑色十月”：九个 AI 开发者平台接连披露安全事件","title_en":"“Black October” for AI Developer Platforms","url":"https://www.wiz.io/blog/black-october-for-ai-developer-platforms"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/fxxkgtzpf2pb8xjnhu4jtis0b","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"fxxkgtzpf2pb8xjnhu4jtis0b","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/fxxkgtzpf2pb8xjnhu4jtis0b","published_at":"2026-10-30T21:17:40Z","ref":"A6","score":83,"selected":true,"source":"TechCrunch：AI（RSS）","summary":"Alphabet、Amazon、Meta、Microsoft 今年计划资本开支合计超 7400 亿美元，投资者情绪从奖励大额投入转向担忧负自由现金流、债务攀升与回报不确定。","title":"科技巨头 AI 资本开支超 7400 亿美元，投资者担忧升温引发市场下跌","title_en":"Cracks are emerging in the AI spending boom","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/30/cracks-are-emerging-in-the-ai-spending-boom/"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/cms82puwtmpssdpbjmajoopr9","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"cms82puwtmpssdpbjmajoopr9","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/cms82puwtmpssdpbjmajoopr9","published_at":"2026-10-30T18:28:00Z","ref":"A7","score":69,"selected":true,"source":"X：Philipp Schmid（Google DeepMind 开发者体验） (@_philschmid)","summary":"Philipp Schmid 转引 Sundar Pichai 的消息：Google Project Suncatcher 在数周前发射原型卫星后，成功向轨道发送指令、启动 TPU、运行提示词，并在地面收到了首个完整回应（一首 haiku），作者称 Gemma 4 成为首个在太空运行的大语言模型。","title":"Project Suncatcher 在轨道卫星上运行 TPU，Gemma 模型首次在太空完成推理并回传回应","title_en":"This incredible. Gemma 4 became the first LLM to run in space?","url":"https://x.com/_philschmid/status/2116235686445502608"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/pd3dehdyyhzkyrjsw4b6bmcyj","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"pd3dehdyyhzkyrjsw4b6bmcyj","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/pd3dehdyyhzkyrjsw4b6bmcyj","published_at":"2026-10-30T17:42:26Z","ref":"A8","score":69,"selected":true,"source":"X：Ado Kukic（Anthropic 开发者关系，Claude Code） (@adocomplete)","summary":"Anthropic 将 Claude 订阅套餐更名：Max 5x 改为 Max，Max 20x 改为 Ultra，价格不变（Max 100 美元/月、Ultra 200 美元/月）。即日起多数老订阅者的认证 Ultra 账号取消 5 小时限制，新账号保留临时限制以防欺诈滥用，周限额不变。","title":"Anthropic 将 Claude Max 套餐更名为 Max 与 Ultra，Ultra 认证账号取消 5 小时限制","title_en":"Ultrathink","url":"https://x.com/adocomplete/status/2116224220539883992"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/v4uwaucyf64u7bkzsyvri08w4","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"v4uwaucyf64u7bkzsyvri08w4","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/v4uwaucyf64u7bkzsyvri08w4","published_at":"2026-10-30T17:15:24Z","ref":"A9","score":80,"selected":true,"source":"The Decoder：AI News（RSS）","summary":"Reddit CEO Steve Huffman 表示 10 月 Reddit 每周流失超过 100 万来自 Google 搜索的访问，股价在业绩强劲的情况下仍下跌超 25%。他称 AI Mode 不会带来流量，Reddit 正在美国以外测试登录墙以遏制抓取，并与 AI 提供商继续数据授权谈判。","title":"Reddit CEO 称 Google AI Mode 不为任何人带来流量，Reddit 每周流失超百万搜索访问","title_en":"Google's AI Mode doesn't drive traffic \"for anybody,\" Reddit CEO Huffman warns the entire web","url":"https://the-decoder.com/googles-ai-mode-doesnt-drive-traffic-for-anybody-reddit-ceo-huffman-warns-the-entire-web/"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/l7y0gkoqx56dt6jxv6x0mcl0h","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"l7y0gkoqx56dt6jxv6x0mcl0h","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/l7y0gkoqx56dt6jxv6x0mcl0h","published_at":"2026-10-30T14:50:37.797000Z","ref":"A10","score":80,"selected":true,"source":"Hacker News：AI 热帖","summary":"BBC 报道称，因担忧企业对 AI 的巨额投资回报，美股科技股连续第二日大跌。","title":"AI 支出担忧引发美股科技股连日下跌，Intel 盘中跌逾 30%","title_en":"US tech stocks see sharp falls over AI cost fears","url":"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cvwy72e0n72yo"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/vyd3tzicoe478uo8njsr8zt2v","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"vyd3tzicoe478uo8njsr8zt2v","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/vyd3tzicoe478uo8njsr8zt2v","published_at":"2026-10-30T13:11:05Z","ref":"A11","score":78,"selected":true,"source":"The Verge：AI（RSS）","summary":"The Verge 分析 Anthropic 提交的 335 页 S-1 招股书，其中创始人信以带来奇迹时代为愿景，同时用 94 页风险因素警告模型可能对人类构成灾难性甚至生存风险。","title":"The Verge 解读 Anthropic S-1 文件中的奇迹叙事与风险披露","title_en":"Silicon Valley wants you to invest in miracles","url":"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1023070/anthropic-ipo-risk-factors-filing-miracles"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/hfhskyex3cjrs3huvpmi1z7bg","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"hfhskyex3cjrs3huvpmi1z7bg","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/hfhskyex3cjrs3huvpmi1z7bg","published_at":"2026-10-30T12:50:00Z","ref":"A12","score":64,"selected":true,"source":"Sierra：Blog（RSS）","summary":"Sierra 宣布本周 ARR 突破 4 亿美元，Q3 单季新增超 1.5 亿美元，从 2 亿到 4 亿仅用五个月，快于此前六个月的翻倍节奏。","title":"Sierra 宣布 ARR 突破 4 亿美元，Q3 单季新增超 1.5 亿美元","title_en":"Our customers’ ambition is accelerating our growth","url":"https://sierra.ai/blog/our-customers-ambition-is-accelerati